Package: paralogSL
Type: Package
Title: Paralog-Based Synthetic Lethality Prioritization via Delta Dependency
Version: 1.1.2
Date: 2026-07-28
Authors@R: c(
    person("Qingqing", "Mo", role = "aut"),
    person("Tao", "Zhu", role = c("aut", "cre"), 
           email = "zhutao@tjh.tjmu.edu.cn",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-0779-2245"))
    )
Description: A lightweight R package for prioritizing paralog-based synthetic
    lethality (SL) candidates through Delta Dependency analysis. Computes DD
    scores from DepMap Chronos gene-effect data, identifies candidate paralog-SL
    pairs using HGNC gene family annotations, and provides discovery-stage
    evaluation metrics. Supports cross-cancer analysis with built-in driver gene
    sets for multiple solid tumor types.
